OL,3,GNEWSAOwner's name on collar rule in
OL,4,Acity dog plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FRestrictions over dogs in public spaces
OL,7,Fin Wolverhampton could be extended and
OL,8,Fa new rule, which the council hopes
OL,9,Freduces the cost of housing stray dogs,
OL,10,Fadded.
OL,12,FThe cabinet will meet to renew a
OL,13,Fcity-wide public space protection order
OL,14,F[PSPO], whose existing rules include
OL,15,Fkeeping dogs on leads near major roads,
OL,16,Ffor three more years.
OL,18,FThe council is looking to add a rule
OL,19,Fthat says they must wear a collar with
OL,20,Fthe owner's name and address.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
