OL,3,GNEWSAOwner's name on collar rule in
OL,4,Acity dog plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FWardens could only return stray dogs to
OL,7,Fowners with up-to-date microchip
OL,8,Finformation or identification tags and
OL,9,Fwithout this, and the authority was
OL,10,Flegally required to care for the
OL,11,Fanimals through approved kennels, which
OL,12,Fcame at a "considerable" cost, it said.
